eval: DotStmt index-of-bounds is undefined, not an error (#33)

Fixes: `test-nestedreferences-0711.json` /  `nestedreferences/two deep`, where it builds a set of reachable indices after double-dereference. Previously, we threw an error.

✅ 946 -> 953 📈

```
p contains x if {
	__local0__ = data.a[i]
	__local1__ = data.a[__local0__]
	x = data.a[__local1__]
}

{
  "data": {
    "a": [
      1,
      2,
      3,
      4
    ]
  }
}

{
  "want_result": [
    {
      "x": [
        3,
        4
      ]
    }
  ]
}
```

